Package: com.dualwieldpad
Name: Dual Wield Pad
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Keeps the picture upright as you close an iPad on its Magic Keyboard: the whole screen is warped in perspective from the hinge angle (read from the accelerometer), so from your seat it stays where it was. An iPad take on hrtowii's dual-wield for MacBooks.
Maintainer: noxygen
Author: noxygen
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0)
